  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your elegant strut and swirl with wand or staff is both delicate and deadly.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Wand Dancer<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Wand Dancer, you don’t need to move at least 5 feet before or after using your spell trigger item. If you do so, however, you gain a +2 dodge bonus to AC against attacks of opportunity until the end of your turn, and you gain an additional bonus on your CMD against disarm, steal, and sunder combat maneuvers made against a spell trigger item you carry or wield. If you expend one use of mythic power when you start using Wand Dancer, your movement until the end of your turn doesn’t provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
